{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with the grandeur of an alien planet, one must feel a deep push to look inward. Piotr Musia\u0142, known for his epic and haunting soundtrack for the Frostpunk series, travels to space for a sci-fi journey about survival that becomes very personal. His OST for The Alters is as diverse as the dedicated game\u2019s unique blend of genres. You will hear a classic sense of wonder fitting of an adventure game as well as dynamic notes that coalesce with a desperate bid for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piotr Musia\u0142: <i>In every genre of music you can find something cool, something that will inspire and intrigue you. [...] I like to draw upon this diversity in search of what I hear deep in my soul.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237500/extras/a74a1990d34b2ff2121ace03a57b5334.poster.avif?t=1752659053\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237500/extras/a74a1990d34b2ff2121ace03a57b5334.webm?t=1752659053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3237500?t=1752659053","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3237500?t=1752659053","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237500/8b8c758a7b9138ee46c943e2ad14a4b63a758e09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752659053","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237500/8b8c758a7b9138ee46c943e2ad14a4b63a758e09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752659053","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with the grandeur of an alien planet, one must feel a deep push to look inward. Piotr Musia\u0142, known for his epic and haunting soundtrack for the Frostpunk series, travels to space for a sci-fi journey about survival that becomes very personal. His OST for The Alters is as diverse as the dedicated game\u2019s unique blend of genres. You will hear a classic sense of wonder fitting of an adventure game as well as dynamic notes that coalesce with a desperate bid for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piotr Musia\u0142: <i>In every genre of music you can find something cool, something that will inspire and intrigue you. [...] I like to draw upon this diversity in search of what I hear deep in my soul.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237500/extras/a74a1990d34b2ff2121ace03a57b5334.poster.avif?t=1752659053\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237500/extras/a74a1990d34b2ff2121ace03a57b5334.webm?t=1752659053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["11 bit studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1601570","name":"The Alters"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237500/83773dc0bd409a95932473cd84d4132cff5e2bcc/header.jpg?t=1752659053","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"11 BIT STUDIOS\u00ae, THE ALTERS\u00ae are registered trademarks of 11 BIT STUDIOS S.A.<br />\r\n\u00a9 11 BIT STUDIOS S.A. All other marks and trademarks are the property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3237500/825948580/c2ad355fdde9245ead48d42a5af6c30d44d988d4/1752654698/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752659